On Mon, Jun 16, 2008 at 12:52:00AM +0300, AndriusV wrote:
> Hello,
> 
> I have AlphaPC clone (Microway Screamer). I successfully installed NetBSD on it, however, I can't get X11 running on it. Is it possible to run X11 with S3 Virge/DX video card in NetBSD/alpha?

Yes, I've done it. I used
Section "Device"
	Option     "XVideo" "off"               # [<bool>]
	Identifier  "Card0"
	Driver      "s3virge"
	VendorName  "S3 Inc."
	BoardName   "ViRGE/DX or /GX" 
	BusID       "PCI:1:10:0"      
EndSection

